      "status": "mathematical proof reconstructed",
      "correspondence": "The source quotient is built on invariant affine charts. Comparison of generic homomorphisms and bundles extends the two companion identities, the multiplier and the marking. Prime-to-q torsion is compared on geometric fibres.",
      "review": "For N=5, q=2 and e=1 the inverse exponent f=3 gives 2⁴ ≡ 1 mod 5. For a supersingular geometric elliptic fibre, a local subgroup of order q is killed by relative Frobenius and agrees in order with its kernel."
